  "description": "My Funeral Has Begun. \n\nAfter her death, Deborah awakens in her sister Irene’s body. To clear Irene of murder charges and change her fate, she sets out to uncover the truth. But three men stand in her way—her stepbrother Abel, ex-fiancé Henry, and the persistent Duke Lahan.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66121346), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%B4%EA%B0%80-%EC%A3%BD%EA%B3%A0-%EB%AA%A8%EB%93%A0-%EA%B2%8C-%EB%B3%80%ED%96%88%EB%8B%A4/4430)\n\n**Official Translations:**      \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/182910)",
